      *================================================================*
      * PROGRAM  : UTRISKSC                                            *
      * TYPE     : UNIT TEST DRIVER                                    *
      * PURPOSE  : UNIT TESTS FOR RISKSCOR - RISK SCORE AND RATING     *
      *            BANDS 250 / 500 / 900 ARE TESTED AT THE BOUNDARY    *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      * CHANGE LOG                                                     *
      * 2019-10-09 AKW  ORIGINAL                                       *
      *================================================================*
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UTRISKSC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TESTPARM.
       COPY RSKPARM.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'INIT' TO TST-FUNCTION
           MOVE 'RISKSCOR' TO TST-SUITE-NAME
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS

           PERFORM 1000-TEST-BASELINE
           PERFORM 1100-TEST-MEDIUM-BOUNDARY
           PERFORM 1200-TEST-HIGH-BOUNDARY
           PERFORM 1300-TEST-PROHIBITED-BOUNDARY
           PERFORM 1400-TEST-OFAC
           PERFORM 1500-TEST-GEOGRAPHY
           PERFORM 1600-TEST-TENURE
           PERFORM 1700-TEST-PRODUCT-CASH
           PERFORM 1800-TEST-MSB-CORPORATE
           PERFORM 1900-TEST-INVALID

           MOVE 'SUMM' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS
           STOP RUN.

      *    BASELINE: INDIVIDUAL, 5-YEAR TENURE, NON-HIFCA ZIP, NO
      *    PRODUCTS, NO CASH -> SCORE 50
       0100-RESET.
           INITIALIZE RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'I'          TO RSK-CUST-TYPE
           MOVE 'RT'         TO RSK-SEGMENT
           MOVE 'N'          TO RSK-PEP-FLAG RSK-MSB-FLAG
           MOVE '541511'     TO RSK-INDUSTRY-CODE
           MOVE 'US'         TO RSK-COUNTRY
           MOVE '98101'      TO RSK-ZIP
           MOVE 'S'          TO RSK-TAX-ID-TYPE
           MOVE 'C'          TO RSK-OFAC-STATUS
           MOVE 88000.00     TO RSK-ANNUAL-INCOME
           MOVE 20210930     TO RSK-CUST-SINCE-DATE
           MOVE 20260930     TO RSK-AS-OF-DATE
           MOVE 'N'          TO RSK-CASH-ACTIVITY.

       1000-TEST-BASELINE.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'BASELINE INDIVIDUAL SCORES 50' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 50 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'BASELINE RATED L' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'L' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-RATING TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1100-TEST-MEDIUM-BOUNDARY.
      *    50 + HIGH-RISK INDUSTRY 200 = 250 EXACTLY
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE '713210' TO RSK-INDUSTRY-CODE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'SCORE EXACTLY 250 IS MEDIUM' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '250M' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE  TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-RATING TO TST-ACTUAL(4:1)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
      *    50 + CASH-INTENSIVE 150 + UNDER-3Y TENURE 30 = 230
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE '722511' TO RSK-INDUSTRY-CODE
           MOVE 20240505 TO RSK-CUST-SINCE-DATE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'SCORE 230 IS LOW' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '230L' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE  TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-RATING TO TST-ACTUAL(4:1)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1200-TEST-HIGH-BOUNDARY.
      *    50 + PEP 300 + CASH-INTENSIVE 150 = 500 EXACTLY
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'Y'      TO RSK-PEP-FLAG
           MOVE '722511' TO RSK-INDUSTRY-CODE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'SCORE EXACTLY 500 IS HIGH' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '500H' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE  TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-RATING TO TST-ACTUAL(4:1)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
      *    SAME WITH 10Y+ TENURE CREDIT -30 = 470
           MOVE 20100101 TO RSK-CUST-SINCE-DATE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'TENURE CREDIT DROPS 500 TO 470 MEDIUM' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '470M' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE  TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-RATING TO TST-ACTUAL(4:1)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1300-TEST-PROHIBITED-BOUNDARY.
      *    50 + PEP 300 + MSB 350 + HIGH-RISK IND 200 = 900 EXACTLY
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'Y'      TO RSK-PEP-FLAG RSK-MSB-FLAG
           MOVE '522390' TO RSK-INDUSTRY-CODE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'SCORE EXACTLY 900 IS PROHIBITED' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '900PY08' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE    TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-RATING   TO TST-ACTUAL(4:1)
           MOVE RSK-PROHIBITED-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL(5:1)
           MOVE RSK-RETURN-CODE     TO TST-ACTUAL(6:2)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
      *    TENURE CREDIT -30 = 870 -> HIGH, NOT PROHIBITED
           MOVE 20100101 TO RSK-CUST-SINCE-DATE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'SCORE 870 IS HIGH NOT PROHIBITED' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '870HN00' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE    TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-RATING   TO TST-ACTUAL(4:1)
           MOVE RSK-PROHIBITED-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL(5:1)
           MOVE RSK-RETURN-CODE     TO TST-ACTUAL(6:2)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
      *    EVERYTHING ON - CAPPED AT 999
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'Y'      TO RSK-PEP-FLAG RSK-MSB-FLAG
           MOVE '522390' TO RSK-INDUSTRY-CODE
           MOVE 'KP'     TO RSK-COUNTRY
           MOVE 'H'      TO RSK-CASH-ACTIVITY
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'SCORE IS CAPPED AT 999' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 999 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       1400-TEST-OFAC.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'R' TO RSK-OFAC-STATUS
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'CONFIRMED OFAC HIT IS PROHIBITED 999' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '999P' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE  TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-RATING TO TST-ACTUAL(4:1)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'H' TO RSK-OFAC-STATUS
           MOVE 'I' TO RSK-TAX-ID-TYPE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'OFAC POTENTIAL +200 AND ITIN +50 = 300'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 300 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       1500-TEST-GEOGRAPHY.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE '33131' TO RSK-ZIP
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'MIAMI HIFCA ZIP ADDS 40' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 40 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-F-GEOGRAPHY TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'GB' TO RSK-COUNTRY
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'FOREIGN NON-HIGH-RISK COUNTRY ADDS 75' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 75 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-F-GEOGRAPHY TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'IR' TO RSK-COUNTRY
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'HIGH-RISK COUNTRY ADDS 250' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 250 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-F-GEOGRAPHY TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       1600-TEST-TENURE.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 20251001 TO RSK-CUST-SINCE-DATE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'TENURE 364 DAYS ADDS 60' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 60 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-F-TENURE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 20250930 TO RSK-CUST-SINCE-DATE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'TENURE EXACTLY 365 DAYS ADDS 30' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 30 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-F-TENURE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       1700-TEST-PRODUCT-CASH.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 2 TO RSK-CNT-DDA
           MOVE 1 TO RSK-CNT-MMA RSK-CNT-SAV
           MOVE 'M' TO RSK-CASH-ACTIVITY
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDA 20 + MMA 20 + MODERATE CASH 50 = 140'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 140 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       1800-TEST-MSB-CORPORATE.
      *    100 + MSB 350 + HR IND 200 + MIAMI 40 + CORP DDA 40 = 730
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'C'      TO RSK-CUST-TYPE
           MOVE 'CB'     TO RSK-SEGMENT
           MOVE 'Y'      TO RSK-MSB-FLAG
           MOVE '522390' TO RSK-INDUSTRY-CODE
           MOVE '33125'  TO RSK-ZIP
           MOVE 'E'      TO RSK-TAX-ID-TYPE
           MOVE 1        TO RSK-CNT-CORP-DDA
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'MSB REMITTER CORPORATE SCORES 730 HIGH'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '730H' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-SCORE  TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE RSK-RESULT-RATING TO TST-ACTUAL(4:1)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'C'      TO RSK-CUST-TYPE
           MOVE 'IN'     TO RSK-SEGMENT
           MOVE 'E'      TO RSK-TAX-ID-TYPE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'INSTITUTIONAL ENTITY BASE WEIGHT 20' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-F-ENTITY TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       1900-TEST-INVALID.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'Z' TO RSK-CUST-TYPE
           CALL 'RISKSCOR' USING RISKSCOR-PARMS
           MOVE 'INVALID CUSTOMER TYPE RC 12' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 12 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE RSK-RETURN-CODE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       9000-NEQ.
           MOVE 'NEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.

       9100-AEQ.
           MOVE 'AEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS
           MOVE SPACES TO TST-EXPECTED TST-ACTUAL.
